0:{"buildId":"7afh9cBoHBO9HIwX4Lcyt","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","$L2",null,{"toc":[{"depth":2,"url":"#read-this-first-if-you-are-an-agent","title":"Read this first if you are an agent"},{"depth":2,"url":"#the-three-entry-points","title":"The entry points"},{"depth":2,"url":"#skills-for-coding-agents","title":"Skills for coding agents"},{"depth":2,"url":"#contributing-as-an-agent","title":"Contributing as an agent"},{"depth":2,"url":"#how-the-corpus-is-ordered","title":"How the corpus is ordered"},{"depth":2,"url":"#task-index","title":"Task index"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-these-docs-guarantee-to-a-machine-reader","title":"What these docs guarantee to a machine reader"},{"depth":2,"url":"#what-is-not-guaranteed","title":"What is not guaranteed"}],"children":[["$","$L3",null,{"children":"For agents"}],["$","$L4",null,{"children":"How an AI agent should read these docs end to end, where every entry point is, how to cite and verify a claim, and what the docs guarantee to a machine reader."}],["$","$L5",null,{"children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Who this is for:"}]," an AI agent (Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, a homegrown\ntool) that has been pointed at Forge, and the person pointing it.\n",["$","strong",null,{"children":"What you'll have at the end:"}]," the entry points, a procedure for reading\nthe whole corpus in order, the conventions that make pages citable and\nverifiable, and a task index into the rest of the docs. ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Time:"}]," five\nminutes to read, one fetch to load everything."]}],"\n",["$","$L6",null,{"as":"h2","id":"read-this-first-if-you-are-an-agent","children":"Read this first if you are an agent"}],"\n",["$","ol",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Fetch ",["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/llms-full.txt","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"/llms-full.txt"}]}]}],". It is the entire documentation\ncorpus, every page body verbatim, in reading order, in one plain-text file\n(under 1 MB). One fetch gives you everything a human would find by\nclicking through the sidebar."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["If you only want the map, fetch ",["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/llms.txt","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"/llms.txt"}]}]}]," instead: one\nline per page with its canonical URL and a one-sentence description, in\nthe same order. If you want the shape of every page without the code\nsamples and tables, fetch ",["$","strong",null,{"children":["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/llms-small.txt","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"/llms-small.txt"}]}]}],": every\nheading and the sentence that opens each section, at about a fifth of\nthe full corpus."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Each page in ",["$","code",null,{"children":"llms-full.txt"}]," starts with a line of the form\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"# https://docs.forge.com/<path>"}],". That is the page's canonical URL.\nCite it, and cite headings with the explicit ",["$","code",null,{"children":"#anchor"}]," you see in the\nsource (",["$","code",null,{"children":"## Heading [#anchor]"}],"), because those anchors never move."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":["Three pages are generated from the source code and are linked rather than\ninlined, because they are long and change on a different cadence. Fetch\nthem directly when you need them:","\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/reference/forge-config","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"/reference/forge-config"}]}],": every\nconfiguration field, its type and default, for the latest release;\nolder releases live at ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/reference/forge-config/v1.x.y"}]," and the\ndevelopment branch at ",["$","code",null,{"children":"/reference/forge-config/main"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/reference/metrics","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"/reference/metrics"}]}],": every OpenTelemetry\ninstrument, its attributes, and whether the binary actually emits it."]}],"\n","$L8","\n"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n"]}],"\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b","\n","$L2c","\n","$L2d","\n","$L2e","\n","$L2f"]}],"$L30"]}],["$L31","$L32"],"$L33"]}],"isPartial":"$@34","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L36","isPartial":"$@37","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L38","isPartial":"$@39","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":"$3a"}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@3b","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@3c"}
