15:["$","p",null,{"children":"Why a build cache carries a Bazel migration skill: we believe closed build\nsystems are dangerous, because a build you cannot read is one you cannot\naudit, reproduce or leave. Bazel is open and hermetic, and Forge's source\nis public. The skill exists to make the move to that pair a task an agent can\ncarry out."}]
