17:["$","p",null,{"children":["Agents are welcome contributors when a person stands behind the change. The\nrules are in\n",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"https://github.com/toxicwind/forge/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#ai-assisted-contributions","children":["$","code",null,{"children":"CONTRIBUTING.md"}]}],"\nand are short: the person submitting the change must understand it well\nenough to answer for any line; the pull request template's \"AI assistance\"\nsection must say which tools helped and how much (\"None\" is a complete\nanswer); and unreviewed generated output, generated issue text nobody edited,\nand generated media are closed without review. Before opening a pull request,\nread ",["$","code",null,{"children":"AGENTS.md"}]," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://github.com/toxicwind/forge/blob/v1.6.5/AGENTS.md","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","data-source-link":"AGENTS.md","data-source-ref":"v1.6.5","title":"AGENTS.md at v1.6.5","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-border bg-surface-elevated px-1.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground no-underline transition-colors hover:border-brand/50 hover:text-brand","children":[["$","svg",null,{"width":"12","height":"12","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6"}]}],"AGENTS.md"]}]," and run the checks it names;\nthe docs gates are listed under\n",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/contribute/docs","children":"Working on the documentation"}],"."]}]
